{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も行きますよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobGfSpCd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちはこんばんは\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わくわく（0 ２↑ ０　２↑）気分で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花見をしに行ったのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう半分くらい緑でした🌸🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間の流れはやくない！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年こそは満開をめざします！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうそう、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は人とお話しするのが大好きなのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は文章の方も饒舌で、、、\n（もうバレているかもしれませんが）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スマホのフリック入力が鬼はやなので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "友達とのやりとりが爆速です📱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メッセージの画面ってその人達の\n関係性が見れるから\nのぞき見するの楽しいよね😃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ！今日はお友達のおづづちゃんと\nれいちゃんのメッセージ画面が